<item><title>South Sudan welcomes new IGAD treaty as it takes effect</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-welcomes-new-igad-treaty-as-it-takes-effect-041e29/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-welcomes-new-igad-treaty-as-it-takes-effect-041e29/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>The 2023 treaty replaces the 1996 agreement and sets a stronger legal and institutional framework for the regional organisation.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 09:31:54 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-welcomes-new-igad-treaty-as-it-takes-effect-041e29/share.jpg" length="42384" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-welcomes-new-igad-treaty-as-it-takes-effect-041e29/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
